re if nothing were changing (p < 0.001).","answer":"Japan is holding more water vapour: about +0.45 kg/m² per decade since 2003, +1.03 kg/m² in total.","how_sure":"Mann-Kendall test with a correction for month-to-month memory: p < 0.001 · 276 months · second test (regression): p < 0.001 · Stability checks: full record: strong evidence; leaving out 2024–2025: evidence; using one average per year: evidence. We report the most cautious.","sure_plain":"Fairly sure. A drift like this would be unusual if nothing were changing. The full record alone looks stronger, but that does not hold up in our stability checks, so we stay cautious.","methods_disagree":false,"decided_by":"both","disagree_text":null,"full_record_level":"strong"},"years_to_detect":null,"emergence":{"year":2016,"ratio_now":1.84,"swing":0.562,"label":"Around 2016, the change on the trend line became bigger than a normal year-to-year swing."},"seasons":[{"season":"DJF","label":"Winter","sen_per_decade":0.194,"ci95":[-0.2441,0.7496],"ci_text":"95% range −0.25 to +0.75","p":0.4986,"display":"+0.19","q":0.652,"passes_fdr":false},{"season":"MAM","label":"Spring","sen_per_decade":0.411,"ci95":[-0.2454,1.1042],"ci_text":"95% range −0.25 to +1.11","p":0.2452,"display":"+0.41","q":0.4545,"passes_fdr":false},{"season":"JJA","label":"Summer","sen_per_decade":0.74,"ci95":[0.1052,1.4127],"ci_text":"95% range +0.10 to +1.42","p":0.0308,"display":"+0.74","q":0.2614,"passes_fdr":false},{"season":"SON","label":"Autumn","sen_per_decade":0.573,"ci95":[-0.3387,1.4331],"ci_text":"95% range −0.34 to +1.44","p":0.1552,"display":"+0.57","q":0.392,"passes_fdr":false}],"monthly_profile":[{"month":1,"label":"Jan","name":"January","sen_per_decade":0.354,"ci95":[-0.1586,1.007],"ci_text":"95% range −0.16 to +1.01","display":"+0.35","p":0.1614,"q":0.392,"passes_fdr":false},{"month":2,"label":"Feb","name":"February","sen_per_decade":-0.032,"ci95":[-0.4871,0.3419],"ci_text":"95% range −0.49 to +0.35","display":"−0.03","p":0.9579,"q":0.9579